{
  "post": {
    "id": "13114628",
    "published": "2017-02-07T07:00:35.000Z",
    "title": "ぎょえ〜！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13114628.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170322160311/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13114628.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "朝起きたらひくほど筋肉痛で笑っちゃいました。特にずっとマイク持ってるほうの手！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "早上起来肌肉酸痛得不行，自己都忍不住笑了。尤其是那只一直举着话筒的手！（笑）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When I woke up this morning my muscles ached so much I just had to laugh. Especially the hand that's always holding the mic! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "活動中ずっとレコーディングでしか歌ってこなかったので、マイクがこんなに重いなんて知らなかったぜ…"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "出道以来一直都只在录音时唱过歌，真不知道话筒原来这么重……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All through my career I'd only ever sung in recording sessions, so I had no idea a mic was this heavy…"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こうやって知らないことを知る機会、やってこなかったことにチャレンジする機会をくれたみんなに感謝を！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "要感谢大家给了我这样的机会，让我能了解自己不知道的事、挑战自己从未做过的事！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Thank you to everyone for giving me chances to learn things I didn't know and to take on things I'd never done!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そしてサポートしてくださる周りの方々に土下座する勢いの礼を！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "同时，也要向身边支持我的各位致以五体投地般的感谢！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And bowing-to-the-ground levels of thanks to everyone around me who supports me!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "本番にそなえて全身湿布マンしちゃうぞ٩( ᐛ )و"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "为了正式演出，我要把自己贴成浑身膏药的“湿布侠”٩( ᐛ )و"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For the big day, I'm going to turn myself into a full-body compress-patch man٩( ᐛ )و"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎ ✂︎"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "★物販先行販売の時間のお知らせ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "★周边商品先行发售时间通知"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "★Advance merch sales times"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "大阪\n先行販売：16:30～18:00\n※終演後も販売いたします。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先行发售：16:30～18:00\n※演出结束后也会继续发售。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Osaka\nAdvance sales: 16:30–18:00\n※Sales will also be held after the show ends."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京\n先行販売：15:00～16:45\n※終演後も販売いたします。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "东京\n先行发售：15:00～16:45\n※演出结束后也会继续发售。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tokyo\nAdvance sales: 15:00–16:45\n※Sales will also be held after the show ends."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "チケットがない方も先行販売中は買えますのでぜひ会場にお立ち寄りください(｀・ω・´)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "没有票的朋友在先行发售期间也可以购买，所以请一定顺路来会场看看哦(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Even if you don't have a ticket, you can buy during the advance sales, so please drop by the venue(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
