      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京大阪ライブにくるみんなは前回にはなかった心の準備をしておいたほうがいいよ（独り言）"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "要来东京、大阪演唱会看演出的大家，最好做好上次没有过的心理准备哦（自言自语）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For everyone coming to the Tokyo and Osaka lives, you'd better get your heart ready in a way you didn't have to last time (talking to myself)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
